<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Jan-July trade surplus up to $413 million.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-July trade surplus up to $413 million.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's foreign trade surplus rose to $413.2 million in January-July, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>	   TURKMENISTAN FOREIGN TRADE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>			Jan-July '96     Jan-June '96    Jan-June '95</p>
<p>    Exports	 1,050.2	    950.3	     1,013.2</p>
<p>    Imports	   637.0	    543.3		 601.3</p>
<p>    Balance	  +413.2	   +407.0		+411.9</p>
<p>Note - Comparative data for January-July 1995 were not available.</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
